            cells: "",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_locations",
            variable: "possible_chest_locs",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22store_locations%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22terrain%22%3A%22Gg%22%2C%22x%22%3A%2211-18%22%2C%22y%22%3A%222-6%22%2C%22variable%22%3A%22possible_chest_locs%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_rand",
            variable: "random",
            values: "0..$($possible_chest_locs.length - 1)",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "xx1",
            value: "$possible_chest_locs[$random].x",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "yy1",
            value: "$possible_chest_locs[$random].y",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "chest_obtained",
            value: "no",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: "$xx1",
            y: "$yy1",
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Fchest-plain-closed.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Lady Jessene",
            unit: "Lady Jessene",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Commander Aethyr",
            unit: "Commander Aethyr",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_object",
            object_id: "ruby_of_fire",
            id: "Prince Haldric",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Haldric and his companions race across the plains to confront the resurgent orcish threat. On the eve of battle, Lady Jessene catches up with Haldric on a fog-covered plain."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Haldric, the elves, we can’t trust them!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("I could have told you that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Haldric, it’s bad. The elves are having second thoughts. They think we might be more trouble than we’re worth. We have to defeat these orcs decisively."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("That does not sound unreasonable."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("More orcs will follow after these. That ruby guarantees it. If more orcs follow us here, the elves seem content to let us fight it out. Then they said they would ‘deal with the survivors’."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Jevyan is here... His familiar, that skull. He won’t let such a lucrative prize as the Ruby of Fire just slip away. Especially when he sees that he has the advantage."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("I have a plan. Jessene, remember that troll-hole? Here, take the Ruby of Fire, hide it in the hole."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Haldric! What! Why?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("Just do it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("Commander Aethyr, did these orcs come on our ships? Did they capture the fleet we sent out?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Commander Aethyr",
            text: _("No, sir! They must have seized all remaining boats on the Green Isle. Our fleet should be returning any day now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-mad.webp",
            text: _("We are a refugee people. We must push back their vanguard, and secure our beachhead. If they capture our ships all is lost. We will be crushed under a tide of orcs."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Burin the Lost",
            unit: "Burin the Lost",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Sir Ruddry",
            unit: "Sir Ruddry",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Sir Ladoc",
            unit: "Sir Ladoc",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Minister Edren",
            unit: "Minister Edren",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "jessica_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Lady Jessene",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Lady Jessene soon departs. In the distance a voice booms:"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tan-Gagar",
            text: _("Drop the gold where it is! We’ve paid our friends enough. There are humans about, I can smell ’em!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            portrait: "portraits/haldric-surprised.webp",
            text: _("We have run out of time... We’ll never beat the orcs to the beach."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_18",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "$xx1",
            y: "$yy1",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "get_chest",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_19",
        on: "get_chest",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "open-chest.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "chest_unit_temp",
            kill: "no",
            side: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$chest_unit_temp.id",
            text: _("I’ve found the orcs’ chest! It’s filled with gold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: "$x1",
            y: "$y1",
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: "$xx1",
            y: "$yy1",
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Fchest-plain-open.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "amount_gold",
            value: 75,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("You retrieve $amount_gold pieces of gold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "gold",
            side: 1,
            amount: 75,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "chest_obtained",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_21",
        on: "branch_if_21",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            condition: "hook",
            hook: "predicate:variable_compare",
            variable: "side_$unit.side|_top_enemy_count",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "side_$unit.side|_top_enemy_count",
            value: "$($this_side_enemies.length + 1)",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_24",
        on: "branch_if_24",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "possible_undead_locs.length",
            greater_than_or_equal_to: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_rand",
            variable: "undead_loc_i",
            values: "0..$|($|possible_undead_locs.length - 1)",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "spawn_x",
            value: "$|possible_undead_locs[$|undead_loc_i].x",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "spawn_y",
            value: "$|possible_undead_locs[$|undead_loc_i].y",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "undead_spawns_so_far",
            value: 1,
            mode: "add",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: "$|possible_undead_locs[$|undead_loc_i].x",
            y: "$|possible_undead_locs[$|undead_loc_i].y",
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "undead_spawns_so_far",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 1,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:lift_fog",
                    side: 1,
                    cells: "$|possible_undead_locs[$|undead_loc_i].x,$|possible_undead_locs[$|undead_loc_i].y",
                    radius: 2,
                    multiturn: "yes",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Norte",
                    text: _("You will be felled by my hand, useless fleshbags!"),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 2,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:lift_fog",
                    side: 1,
                    cells: "$|possible_undead_locs[$|undead_loc_i].x,$|possible_undead_locs[$|undead_loc_i].y",
                    radius: 2,
                    multiturn: "yes",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rabbin",
                    text: _("Embrace your end, mortals!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Burin the Lost",
                    text: _("These monsters seem like they want to be embraced by my hammer!"),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 3,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:lift_fog",
                    side: 1,
